Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.18,0:00:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((贝库塔：哈啊 哈啊 哈啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.04,0:00:20.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是我… 不是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜… 呜哇～！！))
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.17,0:00:38.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊 哈啊 哈啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(咚·萨赞多)怎么了？ 贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.72,0:00:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.52,0:00:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修正在逼近。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.37,0:00:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带着怒火快要爆发了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:52.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.71,0:00:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来要到最终阶段了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:01:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜… 你想干什么？ 贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:04.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 用不着你出场。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.88,0:01:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和纳修由我来做个了断。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.85,0:01:11.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《呵呵 通过得到梅拉古他们的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我自身的功率似乎也相当提升了》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.93,0:01:25.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(纳修)贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.52,0:01:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.10,0:01:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可想死你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.19,0:01:39.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)那就是异晶界的入口。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.71,0:01:43.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光)冲进去吧 游马。嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.01,0:01:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定要把千尊打倒！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.15,0:03:25.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 竟敢对梅拉古和杜尔贝——
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.47,0:03:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊 我确实收下了呵呵呵呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.68,0:03:31.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还不止这些。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.65,0:03:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我已经把基拉古和阿里特的力量也收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.15,0:03:37.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什…什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.14,0:03:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘻嘻嘻嘻。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.72,0:03:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙…贝库塔!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.50,0:03:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吃太多了正有点消化不良呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:54.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就拿你当饭后运动打趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:57.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再把你的力量收下吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.34,0:03:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我居然已经
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.89,0:04:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从来没有恨过谁！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.96,0:04:08.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘻嘻嘻嘻嘻 不错嘛 那副表情真让人受不了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.83,0:04:10.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算在这儿磨磨唧唧 也没用。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.52,0:04:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能给我们这场较量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.92,0:04:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}做个了断的 只有决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.63,0:04:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对吧 纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 贝库塔！！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.35,0:04:31.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.67,0:04:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(两人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.47,0:04:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把你打得粉碎！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被粉碎的 是你才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻是我。 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.51,0:04:56.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 永续魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.53,0:04:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊契约！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡 需要对手玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.80,0:05:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}支付2000生命值才能发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要我支付生命值？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.86,0:05:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当然了吧 这里可是我的城堡。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.83,0:05:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想在这里跟我决斗的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.86,0:05:17.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就得付场地费才行啊嘻嘻嘻嘻。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.12,0:05:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}随你便我一定要把你打趴下。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.59,0:05:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}少开玩笑了 你这混蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.51,0:05:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}契约成立！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～!! 呜…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:33.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}活该！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.94,0:05:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}「唐·萨赞德」的契约成立后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.76,0:05:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}玩家双方各抽1张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.35,0:05:41.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并公开。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 此后每回合的抽卡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.41,0:05:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也必须公开。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.13,0:05:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 如果那张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是魔法卡的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:50.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该玩家直到回合结束
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.95,0:05:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都不能通常召唤怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.15,0:05:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 抽卡。唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:06:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.20,0:06:01.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我抽到的是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.40,0:06:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}精灵·守护者 魔法卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哟 在我的回合 算你走运。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.85,0:06:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 我抽到的是……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.69,0:06:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.63,0:06:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 暗影·魔像！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.11,0:06:21.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着 我再盖放两张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.01,0:06:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)这就是 虚拟世界？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.49,0:06:32.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔和
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.35,0:06:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上千主上 一定就在这里。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.50,0:06:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.95,0:06:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅拉格…… 多鲁贝……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.70,0:06:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们的遗恨 我一定……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.31,0:06:54.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虚拟·混沌·抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.02,0:06:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧根据咚·千的契约效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.15,0:07:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}玩家必须
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.26,0:07:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}公开一张手牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.17,0:07:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我抽到的是魔法卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.79,0:07:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可惜！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.80,0:07:10.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你这家伙直到这个回合结束{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.18,0:07:13.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都不能通常召唤怪兽了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.84,0:07:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶魔法 七皇之剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.67,0:07:18.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.67,0:07:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果你应该很清楚才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧 No.101！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.63,0:07:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}承载未竟之魂的方舟啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.45,0:07:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自光芒不及的深渊浮上吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.69,0:07:36.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寂静荣誉方舟骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后发动七皇之剑的进一步效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.30,0:07:43.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用阶级4的方舟骑士 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.35,0:07:45.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用1只怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.32,0:07:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重构叠放网络。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.99,0:07:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.61,0:07:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.101！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.18,0:07:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未被满足的灵魂守护者啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.56,0:08:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}化为暗黑骑士 粉碎光芒吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.65,0:08:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寂静荣誉暗黑骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 这就是你的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.17,0:08:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超百 No.吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.96,0:08:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 太遗憾了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我场上的暗影傀儡是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以无效一次攻击的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识一下 暗黑骑士的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.72,0:08:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.67,0:08:25.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动暗黑骑士的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.12,0:08:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一回合一次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.10,0:08:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方场上的1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为这张卡的混沌叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以做到。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑灵魂掠夺者！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.15,0:08:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，成为你壁障的怪兽就消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.84,0:08:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}噫！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.55,0:08:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用暗黑骑士直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.01,0:08:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}粉碎吧，贝克塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.91,0:08:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:55.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.37,0:08:58.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。嗯。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.48,0:09:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站起来！胜负从现在才开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.68,0:09:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会把你消灭得无影无踪。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:12.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2800的伤害……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.34,0:09:18.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多谢啦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.29,0:09:20.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直在看你和{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超百 No.的厉害之处{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我非常清楚。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.84,0:09:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你一定会被愤怒驱使，对我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.16,0:09:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我本以为你会用那张暗黑骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.13,0:09:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我造成大伤害呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.18,0:09:43.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！ 陷阱发动 混沌升腾！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.17,0:09:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.02,0:09:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在受到对方 CNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}2000点以上的战斗伤害时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.27,0:09:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.77,0:09:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.29,0:09:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的作战 全～都在我预料之中！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.17,0:10:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从额外卡组将1只 CNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.14,0:10:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}随机特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.65！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.74,0:10:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}裁断魔王 审判恶魔！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.17,0:10:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不惜承受2800的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.61,0:10:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙盯上的就是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.30,0:10:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤1只 CNo.吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.34,0:10:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘻嘻嘻嘻！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.32,0:10:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放1张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.84,0:10:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 我的回合了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.40,0:10:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这抽卡将决定你的命运。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.70,0:10:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀，抽到魔法卡了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:47.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但这可不是普通的魔法卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.13,0:10:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动混沌狂宴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.85,0:10:52.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有1只 CNo.怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.67,0:10:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将千尊的契约
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:10:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}送入墓地来发动。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.04,0:11:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后从额外卡组
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将3只混沌超百 No.怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果无效化特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.82,0:11:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.85,0:11:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先是 CNo.104！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.37,0:11:14.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}假面魔导士 暗影！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.66,0:11:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，让我介绍一下我的新朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.07,0:11:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.102！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.65,0:11:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙是 多尔贝的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.70,0:11:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}安霍利·闪电 高贵·恶魔！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后最后是压轴的 这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用热烈的掌声欢迎他们吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.15,0:11:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.103！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.37,0:11:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}神葬零娘 拉格纳·无限！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.63,0:11:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅拉格……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.67,0:11:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以上 原本是多尔贝和梅拉格的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.64,0:12:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 是 我 的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.21,0:12:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}CNo.！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.13,0:12:08.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.51,0:12:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呵呵呵呵！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.03,0:12:11.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样 纳修？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.49,0:12:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}重要同伴的 No.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在敌人场上的心情如何啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.79,0:12:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寂寞吗？ 难受吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:20.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.94,0:12:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅拉格也好 多尔贝也好 都不在了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.58,0:12:26.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}基拉古也好 阿里特也好 大家都
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.54,0:12:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是 全都是 我的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.00,0:12:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就一个人！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.92,0:12:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}孤零零的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一个人…鲨鱼！！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦 这家伙是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.49,0:12:49.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈！ 太好了 纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:13:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对孤零零的你来说怀念的朋友到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.16,0:13:03.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闭嘴！ 我和那家伙如今是敌人！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.60,0:13:05.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:09.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被甩了呢 游马。真可怜。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.01,0:13:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.94,0:13:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 没关系！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等这场决斗结束后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.11,0:13:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来 你们的对手由我 慢慢{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.25,0:13:19.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等这场决斗结束之后{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.45,0:13:21.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来就轮到你们几个了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.47,0:13:23.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我会慢慢{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.56,0:13:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好好陪你们玩个够！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.27,0:13:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你休想有下次！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.43,0:13:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈！ 梅拉古和多尔贝的遗恨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.45,0:13:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是想说你要替他们雪耻吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.99,0:13:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.83,0:13:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(众人)啊!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.75,0:13:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅拉古 多尔贝 大家！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.34,0:14:00.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}放马过来啊!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.26,0:14:02.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害 好厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}力量涌上来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那 那是什么玩意？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.45,0:14:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吸收了巴利安七皇中4人力量后的姿态。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.07,0:14:17.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样！ 我这全新的姿态！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.11,0:14:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这一切全都
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.44,0:14:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多亏了那群废物啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.43,0:14:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那时候！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.42,0:14:28.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了吗？ 这个地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.82,0:14:32.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 这里就是我和你的因缘之地！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.57,0:14:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在迷宫遗迹里 被你这家伙打飞的我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.33,0:14:40.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拼了命才逃回自己的国家！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.63,0:14:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((呼 呼…))
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.07,0:14:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 死缠烂打的你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.44,0:14:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又追着活下来的我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.43,0:14:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}独自一人 闯进了这个地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.61,0:15:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错… 我想起来了！ 全部。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为我和你的战斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.74,0:15:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无可替代的同伴们丢了性命…。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.79,0:15:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 无法原谅你这混蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.58,0:15:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 当我闯进这个地方的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.61,0:15:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙早已将所有家臣和民众处刑{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}结果就他一个人杵在那儿。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.27,0:15:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，那事儿啊，呵呵呵！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.11,0:15:28.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}碍事啊一个个全都是。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.46,0:15:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说什么别再打仗了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}净说些没骨气的话的家伙一堆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.15,0:15:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}碍事，碍事得不行。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.59,0:15:39.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以我就把他们全收拾了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会……太过分了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.08,0:15:43.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被诅咒的王宫传说……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.78,0:15:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然，这座遗迹的传说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.91,0:15:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是贝库塔还是人类的时候……{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.90,0:15:52.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是渣到极致啊，贝库塔。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.12,0:15:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！就这点程度也算渣？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.79,0:15:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太天真了！太天真了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:16:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毕竟我第一个下手收拾掉的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.95,0:16:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是我自己的老爹和老娘啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.42,0:16:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.60,0:16:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的……父母！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.29,0:16:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夺走所有人的性命之后
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.26,0:16:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}皇子仅剩一人 自绝性命。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.90,0:16:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错我把碍事的家伙全都排除了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是无敌的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.74,0:16:31.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到那天败给你为止。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.28,0:16:35.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修！我又一次输给了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.28,0:16:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且还是在自家的王宫里！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.10,0:16:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是惨啊！真是不甘心啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.78,0:16:45.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以啊 在同一个地方这次一定要我来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.07,0:16:47.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你打垮！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用你重要的同伴的力量把你打垮！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.61,0:16:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.07,0:16:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上吧 纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.99,0:17:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}首先用安布拉尔 攻击暗黑骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.07,0:17:06.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.11,0:17:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动暗黑骑士的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}持有混沌超量单位的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.54,0:17:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑骑士被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.45,0:17:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这只怪兽从墓地特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.97,0:17:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}归来吧，从轮回中！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.11,0:17:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.97,0:17:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恢复暗黑骑士攻击力的数值。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.95,0:17:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈，但我的攻击还没结束呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用高贵恶魔攻击暗黑骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:55.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.46,0:17:58.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有混沌超量单位的暗黑骑士
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.35,0:17:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经不能再特殊召唤了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.90,0:18:02.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来用拉格纳无限
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.65,0:18:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(拉格纳无限)哈啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.41,0:18:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.61,0:18:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夏克！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.03,0:18:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.75,0:18:21.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？被梅拉古的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.17,0:18:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}狠狠揍了一顿的感觉。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接着上，贾吉·戴比尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.41,0:18:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对纳修直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.94,0:18:33.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃……。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.43,0:18:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.12,0:18:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.78,0:18:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}转眼间生命值就变成100了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.62,0:18:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈，活该。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.76,0:18:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可不会让你轻易得逞。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.79,0:18:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要好好折磨你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.61,0:18:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再把你送进地狱，纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:57.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖上两张卡回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.45,0:18:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.46,0:19:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.09,0:19:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.59,0:19:08.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动分裂守护者！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.78,0:19:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（纳修）在自己场上
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.36,0:19:11.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当场上没有怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得对方场上守备力最高的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.27,0:19:16.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽的控制权。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.61,0:19:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，当守备力相同的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.26,0:19:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有2只以上时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.78,0:19:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得控制权的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.76,0:19:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}由对方玩家选择。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.65,0:19:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在你的场上守备力较高的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.94,0:19:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贵妇恶魔还是拉格纳·无限。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.42,0:19:34.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这两只怪兽中的一只我就收下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.61,0:19:35.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.41,0:19:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙最初抽到的卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会在这里使用我早就看穿了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 守卫封锁！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.45,0:19:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡将场上的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.90,0:19:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有怪兽的守备力变为零！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.26,0:19:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后每有1只守备力为0的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.78,0:19:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就给你400点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.73,0:19:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}合计1600的伤害！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.95,0:20:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被看穿了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.62,0:20:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.51,0:20:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再见啦，纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.65,0:20:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.41,0:20:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动永续陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.22,0:20:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}额外充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.94,0:20:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以让效果伤害无效！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.74,0:20:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.37,0:20:26.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.39,0:20:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为我不知道自己手牌里有
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.92,0:20:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}分裂守护者{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.11,0:20:32.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就什么都不会动手这么想的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.75,0:20:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可没那么天真！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.09,0:20:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动的分裂守护者的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.89,0:20:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果还活着。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.17,0:20:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为守卫者之力，现在你的场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.74,0:20:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽的守备力全部变成零！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.41,0:20:48.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，选吧，要献给我的1只！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.82,0:20:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……审判恶魔！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.26,0:20:59.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，不过是个攻击力1600的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.59,0:21:00.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就送给你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.83,0:21:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样就足够了。什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.41,0:21:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}额外充能的更进一步效果\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.75,0:21:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将这张卡送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:10.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只超量怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.41,0:21:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}按照刚才无效掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.92,0:21:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果伤害的数值来提升！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.73,0:21:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太厉害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:22.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，审判恶魔的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.45,0:21:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是场上最高的了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.97,0:21:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用审判恶魔攻击暗影！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.78,0:21:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.17,0:21:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.44,0:21:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种感觉到底是……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.11,0:21:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什 什么啊 这道光！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.58,0:21:51.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.48,0:21:53.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过遗迹的 No.们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.63,0:21:55.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将超手牌红·No.们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.74,0:21:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.63,0:22:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那座遗迹主人的真正记忆就会苏醒。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么说……

